3. Can multiple changes happen quickly for the same customer, policy, or mortgagee? If so, must those changes be processed in the same order they occurred?

4. Which downstream systems will receive these messages? Are any additional systems already planned?

5. Will DMS capture changes directly from the existing Aurora tables, or will the application write separate business-event records for DMS to capture?

6. What is the expected average and peak number of database changes per second, and what is the typical message size?

